  "releaseNotes": "• BREAKING: read-side methods on IHealthService and IHealthWorkoutService.Read return named Result types so callers can distinguish \"no data\" from \"platform failed.\"\n• CHANGED: platform exceptions bubble to a single error boundary instead of being swallowed by inner helpers.\n• ADDED: HealthTimeRange clamps StartTime to Unix epoch (1970-01-01 UTC) to prevent sentinel-value blowups in platform aggregation queries.\n• FIXED: GetEarliestAccessibleDateTime returns the epoch floor instead of DateTime.MinValue.",
